Task: Preserve attachment-embedded image blocks through canonical normalization and rendering.

Root cause: the reported Slack response stores an animated image block inside a legacy attachment. SlackAttachment did not deserialize attachment blocks, so canonicalization discarded the image and retained only the fallback text.

Implementation: deserialize attachment blocks, normalize them with file context before legacy attachment fallback, render the normalized image node, and avoid duplicate fallback text when embedded blocks are usable. Raw attachment wire content remains discarded after canonicalization.

